<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n116145" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὠκῠ-τόκος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>causing quick and easy
				birth,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σελήνη</span> (i. e. Artemis), <i><span class="en">
				Tim.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				28
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> of a river, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὠ. πεδίων ἐπινίσεται</span>”
				<i>giving quick increase,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>OC</u>
					689
				</span></i>
			 (lyr.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὠκύτοκον, τό,</span>
			<i>quick birth, easy delivery,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				4.35
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
